      "instance_name": "woman",
      "label": "woman in bikini and tactical gear",
      "description": "A blonde woman wearing a black bikini top and tactical gear including leg straps and gloves, standing outdoors in a grassy field. She is positioned centrally in the image, looking toward the camera with a neutral expression. Her body is partially exposed, and she appears to be part of a staged scene, possibly for a film or photoshoot, given the presence of a camera crew and a man directing her with a firearm. The visual presentation objectifies her, aligning with misogynistic tropes of hypersexualization and objectification.",
