      "instance_name": "objectification",
      "label": "Objectification",
      "description": "The meme uses the visual of the woman's body — particularly her revealing bikini and tactical gear — to portray her as an object of male gaze or control. This is a form of objectification that reduces her to her physical appearance and sexualizes her, aligning with misogynistic tropes that devalue women's autonomy and agency.",
